cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ISO 19166 B2GM: BIM to GIS conceptual mapping"
abstract: >-
  An implementation of the ISO/TS 19166 BIM to GIS conceptual mapping (B2GM)
  framework. An IFC model is mapped to CityGML through the four stages of the
  standard, Perspective Definition, Coordinate Mapping, Element Mapping and LoD
  Mapping, driven by rules in a configuration file. All eleven Table 8 LoD
  operators are implemented, coordinates are transformed into the destination
  CRS, and the output validates against the official OGC CityGML 2.0 and 3.0
  schemas.
type: software
